  "about_hero_role_3": "Cloud & Architecture",
  "about_hero_bio": "I am passionate about technology, knowledge and the chance to turn ideas into solutions that make a difference.\n\nMy curiosity has always made me want to understand how things work, whether exploring a new technology, studying software architecture, reading a good book or finding different ways to solve a problem.\n\nIn software engineering I found a place where I can combine creativity, logic and constant learning. I like to build, experiment, question decisions and understand not only how to develop a solution, but why it should be built that way.\n\n**But my life is not only about code and projects.**\n\nI also enjoy reading, going on long walks, visiting new places, studying different subjects and sharing experiences with people who have something to teach. I believe good ideas come when we are open to new perspectives, and that sharing knowledge is one of the best ways to grow.\n\nThis space brings a bit of all of that together: my journey in technology, projects, studies, discoveries and thoughts on software engineering, architecture and innovation.\n\n**I am always learning, building and looking for new ways to do better.**",
